{"4347010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Just One Bite", "steam_appid": 4347010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4931580, 5095880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/24034df5bb0d3932242b863a3ba39eb6.avif?t=1787838054\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras_big/24034df5bb0d3932242b863a3ba39eb6.webp?t=1787838054 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, monsters began to appear inside food all around the world.<br>Your mission is to become a wooden puppet crafted by humans and gather as much food as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/75f5dc1cd5f2650ca0ffaafe7dd865a3.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/75f5dc1cd5f2650ca0ffaafe7dd865a3.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/75f5dc1cd5f2650ca0ffaafe7dd865a3.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food? Monster?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is that really food in front of you?<br>You won’t know until it’s already in your mouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/5b8c235ccee50c220527bb2d11aab94b.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/5b8c235ccee50c220527bb2d11aab94b.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/5b8c235ccee50c220527bb2d11aab94b.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Fork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield a powerful weapon you can control freely—<br>it will act as your very hands and feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/bfc7221b6c40893e4846293943ce1239.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/bfc7221b6c40893e4846293943ce1239.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/bfc7221b6c40893e4846293943ce1239.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Truck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modified truck with various functions will help you. Ride the truck to a safe zone and prepare for your next adventure.<br>but don’t expect it to be very sturdy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/71ca1dfb587a56a46993993c17817063.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/71ca1dfb587a56a46993993c17817063.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/71ca1dfb587a56a46993993c17817063.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Food Into Money!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, food <i>is</i> money.<br>Use the food you collect to upgrade your fork and your body.<br>How much food can you gather, and how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/b9c15829cf27fe2086e132ce318270c0.avif?t=1787838054\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras_big/b9c15829cf27fe2086e132ce318270c0.webp?t=1787838054 width=1560 height=238 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/24034df5bb0d3932242b863a3ba39eb6.avif?t=1787838054\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras_big/24034df5bb0d3932242b863a3ba39eb6.webp?t=1787838054 width=1560 height=447 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, monsters began to appear inside food all around the world.<br>Your mission is to become a wooden puppet crafted by humans and gather as much food as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/75f5dc1cd5f2650ca0ffaafe7dd865a3.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/75f5dc1cd5f2650ca0ffaafe7dd865a3.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/75f5dc1cd5f2650ca0ffaafe7dd865a3.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food? Monster?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is that really food in front of you?<br>You won’t know until it’s already in your mouth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/5b8c235ccee50c220527bb2d11aab94b.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/5b8c235ccee50c220527bb2d11aab94b.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/5b8c235ccee50c220527bb2d11aab94b.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Fork</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wield a powerful weapon you can control freely—<br>it will act as your very hands and feet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/bfc7221b6c40893e4846293943ce1239.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/bfc7221b6c40893e4846293943ce1239.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/bfc7221b6c40893e4846293943ce1239.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Floating Truck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modified truck with various functions will help you. Ride the truck to a safe zone and prepare for your next adventure.<br>but don’t expect it to be very sturdy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/71ca1dfb587a56a46993993c17817063.poster.avif?t=1787838054\" width=1170 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/71ca1dfb587a56a46993993c17817063.webm?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/71ca1dfb587a56a46993993c17817063.mp4?t=1787838054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turn Food Into Money!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, food <i>is</i> money.<br>Use the food you collect to upgrade your fork and your body.<br>How much food can you gather, and how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras/b9c15829cf27fe2086e132ce318270c0.avif?t=1787838054\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/extras_big/b9c15829cf27fe2086e132ce318270c0.webp?t=1787838054 width=1560 height=238 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A survival horror game you can play alone or with up to 4 players. Gather as much food as possible to survive and grow stronger. But not all food is normal.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Korean, Vietnamese, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4347010/03ecc93dfadbe1b3ed47c387d9a007d3a289a9e8/hea